# Conformance twin of the two shipped glossary interop lowerings' honest loss ledger
# (crates/pipeline/src/stages/lang_glossary.rs `build_lowering_corpus`). The G4 producer
# folds one lang:ProjectionEmission per glossary lowering target into
# graph/lang-projection-corpus of gmeow.gts; both are LOSSY sound-under-approximations, so
# each carries logic:SoundUnderApproximation (NOT logic:ExactPreservation) and enumerates —
# as lang:unsupportedConstruct — every construct the target cannot carry. The drop lists here
# are byte-faithful to the producer's LOWERING_TARGETS table so the fixture exercises the
# loss ledger the shipped bundle emits, never a second source of truth.
#
# The competency query glossary-projection-loss.rq runs over this fixture: its answer is
# exactly the two emissions' declared drops — the four OntoLex-vartrans drops and the six
# TBX drops — each at logic:SoundUnderApproximation.

@prefix lang:  <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/> .
@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .
@prefix ex:    <http://example.org/lang/> .

# ── The two carried glossary source senses the lowerings project FROM ──────────────
# (the lang:Sense range lang:projectsSource names; present for faithfulness — the query
#  reads only the target + preservation + drop columns).
ex:glossarySenseComposedForm a lang:Sense .
ex:glossarySenseEntityExistence a lang:Sense .

# ── Emission 1: OntoLex vartrans (RDF-native; keeps the sense/concept structure) ────
ex:glossaryEmissionVartrans a lang:ProjectionEmission ;
    lang:projectionTargetName "OntoLex vartrans" ;
    lang:projectsSource ex:glossarySenseComposedForm , ex:glossarySenseEntityExistence ;
    logic:preservationKind logic:SoundUnderApproximation ;
    lang:unsupportedConstruct
        "the lang:TranslationUnit crossing's logic:Correspondence law-spine (gmeow:glossaryUnit)" ,
        "the crossing's logic:preservationKind judgment" ,
        "the gmeow:glossaryPredicate annotation-predicate provenance" ,
        "the lang:DeclaredTerminologyHomograph declaration that split the concept" .

# ── Emission 2: TBX (ISO 30042) (flat concept/langSet/term termbase) ────────────────
ex:glossaryEmissionTbx a lang:ProjectionEmission ;
    lang:projectionTargetName "TBX (ISO 30042)" ;
    lang:projectsSource ex:glossarySenseComposedForm , ex:glossarySenseEntityExistence ;
    logic:preservationKind logic:SoundUnderApproximation ;
    lang:unsupportedConstruct
        "the OntoLex Frege-triangle sense structure (lang:Sense / lang:evokes / lang:LexicalConcept)" ,
        "the lang:TranslationUnit crossing's logic:Correspondence law-spine (gmeow:glossaryUnit)" ,
        "the crossing's logic:preservationKind judgment" ,
        "the gmeow:glossaryPredicate annotation-predicate provenance" ,
        "the lang:DeclaredTerminologyHomograph declaration that split the concept" ,
        "the gmeow:glossaryTerm IRI grounding (TBX terms are plain strings)" .
